{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-13_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-13","title":"突破外圍防線","storyCode":"14-15","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-13_end.txt","sourceHash":"b2098c648d386a351cd7a08eb00269c68b5af72722b726409c8213f36da667b5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g9_airshipdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有嗎？下一個要被炸成碎片的怪影子在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪異的影子","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，還真有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐，削減它們的數量恐怕沒有意義，它們不過是死魂靈力量的投影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要死魂靈還寄宿在這艘船上，它的這些造物就無窮無盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是它拖延時間的手段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就再給這艘船添幾個窟窿，直到死魂靈疼到決定靈魂出竅怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船的一切都不過是死魂靈的軀殼，就算破壞了這艘船的外殼，甚至把飛空艇炸成了兩段，死魂靈依然可以用巫術力量保證它的運行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕這種運行只是暫時的，也足夠他們接觸到“阿喃那”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要徹底停下飛空艇，我們必須找到並摧毀死魂靈的核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我說，我們薩卡茲的怪東西還真多，真不讓人放鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就不能靠炸彈直接解決問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一整個高速戰艦編隊的主炮齊射也許能徹底摧毀它的外殼，讓它用巫術也無法輕易維持自己的運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我們就去找那個什麼核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總有一天我也要給自己弄門炮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們怎麼才能找到死魂靈的核心？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不十分確定，作為這艘飛空艇真正的中樞，它一定被層層保護，小心地藏匿在了某個艙室中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有深入飛空艇我們才能查出它的蛛絲馬跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這同時意味著，我們的敵人阻擊我們也會變得輕而易舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間來不及。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"死魂靈對於飛空艇的掌握是絕對的嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理論上是。但飛空艇體積龐大，它的注意力也是有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲來過這艘船，她不也全鬚全尾地逃出來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，當然也有可能是因為她不是個徹頭徹尾的薩卡茲。她感受不到死魂靈精神上的壓迫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們需要分工合作。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們需要想辦法分散死魂靈的注意力。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你的意思是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"人在劇痛時不會注意到蟲子爬上了褲腳。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"W，我需要你的幫助。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，這是不是你早就籌劃好的陷阱，就等著現在說呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是最合適的人選。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"你在製造動靜這一塊無人能及。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這我倒不否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，爭取時間，又是爭取時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但事先說好了，這次我不是你們的餌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"若死魂靈比我們想像的要更加敏銳……","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你對阿米婭使了個眼色，阿米婭一愣，輕輕向你點了點頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"W，點火。","value":"5","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，動靜夠了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，蟲子們，別被輕易找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在見到她之前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，阿米婭，沿著W打開的缺口進入飛空艇內部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟緊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的機會，只有一次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空空蕩蕩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，軍事委員會已經撤走了全部的乘員，他們也知道這次行動的危險性。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，如果飛空艇真的與“阿喃那”相碰撞……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"到那時，會發生什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿喃那”會同化它所接觸的一切訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些訊息中，包含了所有的有機物，無機物，乃至人格，情感……所有的一切，都會被源石的結晶包覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那特蕾西婭小姐與死魂靈……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，選擇駛向那裡，意味著他們很清楚這個結果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們究竟想從源石中得到什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"低沉滄桑的聲音從船艙的深處響起。\n但是沒有人影，走廊中仍然空空蕩蕩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這聲音……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……很熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個地方，它的聲音……能讓我們所有人聽見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……死魂靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它還是注意到我們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只是一眨眼的時間，無數古怪的陰影就填滿了原本空空蕩蕩的走廊。\n死魂靈的話語也從它們的震動中發出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，準備戰鬥！阿米婭，保護博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"漆黑的長矛一瞬間就在阿米婭的指尖凝結，隨即飛射而出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可它卻被牆壁與樓梯啃食得一乾二淨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人太多，我們需要轉移！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"可每一條走廊都是那麼相似，每一條樓梯連接的彷彿都是相同的空間。\n這些不過是死魂靈的血管，而它的意志，卻可以在任何地方浮現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不行，我們甩不掉它們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是時候了，W！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的爆炸讓你睜不開眼，但計劃仍按照你原本想像的那樣被執行著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，換邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，讓你養的小怪物抓住這個累贅，我們要快速——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這裡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，不祥的預感在你心頭猛然炸響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"情況不對——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"W炸彈的威力，不會有這麼大！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"藉著爆炸的餘威，整條走廊在它主人的命令之下撕裂了。\n你感覺自己正滑向下一層的走廊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老女人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你努力維持住平衡，向凱爾希原本所在的位置看去，卻只能看見凱爾希被漆黑的陰影所吞沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈自己撕裂了這裡的結構！它想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的坍塌聲傳來，阿米婭消失在了正在崩潰的走廊的另一頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，等著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道黑影閃過，撲開了你和W，在你們側身的刹那，巫術的鋒刃就切過了你們剛剛所在的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（焦躁的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"它還是沒能鈎住你的衣領，你向著下層的走廊滾去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（催促的吼叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在你重重地摔在下層地板上之前，一隻手拎住了你的後領。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住你了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，應該說，你終於落在我手裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"“嘎吱”……“嘎吱”……“嘎吱”……\n鋼鐵扭曲的聲音迴盪在狹小的空間內，艦艇在咀嚼腔體內的黑暗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了迫使我落入這處封閉的陷阱，你做了很多——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今的你，是否連自己的名字都已忘記了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人回應。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“嘎吱”……唯有金屬拉扯的聲音在蔓延。銳利的碎屑不斷從艦體上被剝落，被牽引……\n凱爾希知道，如果將此時此刻這處未知的空間，比作一間充斥著磁場的房間——\n那麼牽引所有致命之物的中心，一定就是她自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威脅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來儘管已經燃燒自己多年，你依舊保有理智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果你混亂的意識裡，還留存了一點曾經在卡茲戴爾的記憶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該清楚，死亡的威脅，對我毫無意義。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"寂靜。\n但凱爾希能夠感知到，那些將自己裹挾至此處的陰影仍在黑暗中注視她。\n伺機待發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你理應知道……畢竟特蕾西婭她很清楚這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也在聽，對吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能在這艘艦艇上感受到你的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為，你會在這裡等我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希伸手輕觸牆壁，感受著這艘艦艇的生命。\n冰冷粗糙的金屬……以及源石。\n儘管在黑暗之中，凱爾希依舊能清楚地看到，那些源石正在生長，以及同化周邊的一切——\n但獨獨避開了她的手指所觸及的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石的自然增殖，如今已經可以被你影響到如此地步……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這些源石繼續生長下去，整艘飛空艇會在撞上那裡之前完成結晶化……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那其中的所有人都——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也包括我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你想告訴我的事情？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人應答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最初的源石，你，特雷西斯，薩卡茲……我原以為自己對你的計劃已經有了足夠的猜測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但恐怕你走得比我所猜想的更遠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使將我困在這裡，我也不認為你真正提防的人是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總是做出一些令我也很頭疼的事情，特蕾西婭，就像過去一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……和過去一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭，現在的你，是否還相信……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉還能有一個“未來”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陰影從凱爾希的腳下延展。\n漆黑的海洋從黑暗中湧出，轉瞬便要淹沒其中的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑暗再次恢復了寧靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
